{"hymn":"S207","parent":"E266","quality":"exact","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":0},"title":"Unción divina en mí mora","subtitle":"La plenitud del Espíritu—La unción","syl":{"n1":["Un","i"],"n2":["ción","t"],"n3":["di","i"],"n4":["vi","m"],"n5":["na","t"],"n6":"en","n7":"mí","n8":["mo","i"],"n9":["ra,","t"],"n10":"Y","n11":["me‿en","i"],"n12":["se","m"],"n13":["ña","t"],"n14":["to","i"],"n15":["do‿a","m"],"n16":["quí;","t"],"n17":"En","n18":"el","n19":["Se","i"],"n20":["ñor","t"],"n21":"me","n22":["guí","i"],"n23":["a","t"],"n24":"a","n25":["vi","i"],"n26":["vir,","t"],"n27":"Su","n28":["pre","i"],"n29":["sen","m"],"n30":["cia","t"],"n31":["tra","i"],"n32":["e‿a","t"],"n33":"mí.","n34":"En","n35":["mi‿es","i"],"n36":["pí","m"],"n37":["ri","m"],"n38":["tu","t"],"n39":["mo","i"],"n40":["ra","t"],"n41":["la‿un","i"],"n42":["ción,","t"],"n43":"Oh,","n44":"sí","n45":["mo","i"],"n46":["ra","t"],"n47":"la","n48":["un","i"],"n49":["ción,","t"],"n50":"Me","n51":"ha","n52":["de‿en","i"],"n53":["se","m"],"n54":["ñar;","t"],"n55":"En","n56":["mi‿es","i"],"n57":["pí","m"],"n58":["ri","m"],"n59":["tu","t"],"n60":["mo","i"],"n61":["ra","t"],"n62":["la‿un","i"],"n63":["ción,","t"],"n64":"Y","n65":["siem","i"],"n66":["pre","t"],"n67":"me","n68":["en","i"],"n69":["se","m"],"n70":["ña","m"],"n71":["rá.","t"]},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["Cuando el Espíritu se mueve,","Suave‿y puro‿ungüento es;","Y donde‿está la sangre eficaz,","Se puede la‿unción mover."]},{"label":"3.","lines":["Unge con Su divina esencia","Para darse a conocer,","Para que pueda Su‿elemento así","Saturar todo mi ser."]},{"label":"4.","lines":["Por la unción de vida‿interna","Yo me muevo‿en comunión;","Andando en Dios, la luz de la verdad,","En Su gracia‿encuentro amor."]}]}